{
  "id": "c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Talent or hard work?",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think anyone can become good at anything with enough practice?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what is something you have worked really hard at?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, who has inspired you to improve at something?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you feel when you compare yourself with others?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e49-a1",
            "c1-e49-a2",
            "c1-e49-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people developing a skill. Choose two of the pictures and say what has led these people to this point, and what sacrifices they might have made.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these skills would you most like to have?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e49-b1",
            "c1-e49-b2",
            "c1-e49-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people learning or showing skill. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be thinking, and how important natural ability is here.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think natural talent matters more than practice?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some factors in becoming outstanding at something, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these factors contribute to a person's success?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most decisive?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about talent and hard work.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent is success the result of luck rather than talent or effort?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should schools identify gifted children and teach them separately?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think there is too much pressure on young people to be exceptional?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is perfectionism a strength or a weakness?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, why do some talented people never fulfil their potential?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should society reward effort or achievement?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e49-talent-or-hard-work/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
